### Attenuation function

Support a configurable distance-versus-logA0 table.

Example structure:

| Distance (km) | log10(A0) |
|---|---|
| 0 | -1.3 |
| 60 | -2.8 |
| 100 | -3.0 |
| 400 | -4.5 |
| 1000 | -5.85 |

These are SeisComP documentation example values.

**Do not adopt this example as the operational Philippine calibration.**

